June 21st $ETH  Midday Analysis
The 15-minute timeframe is in a neutral consolidation pattern, with the bulls and bears indicators on the dashboard signaling a neutral stance; the battle between buyers and sellers shows no clear advantage;
Market logic breakdown: The morning session saw a spike to test support and absorb short seller pressure, followed by a quick bullish rebound that faced profit-taking, currently in a consolidation phase after the upward move;
Trading suggestion from Yifan: Range around 1760-1810, with targets near 1700-1650 #BTC #ETH #韩国拟扩加密旅行规则至小额

Evening analysis on the 22nd
Just got some good news that pumped the market a bit
Cycle resonance bullish: 1-hour and 4-hour cycles have both broken through the upper Bollinger band, mid-term bullish trend resonance is in play, and there's technical basis for upward continuation;
Overbought pullback risk: Price has moved away from the upper Bollinger band, 4-hour indicators are in the overbought zone, short-term there’s a need for a corrective pullback, chasing longs at these highs has poor risk-reward;
Positive funding flow: The market is seeing continued net inflows, with no signals of large-scale fund exits, and the bullish fundamentals are quite strong;
Medium to long-term selling pressure risk: Concentrated sell-off at the historical high of 67255, the price reaching this area will face significant selling pressure; crypto contracts are super volatile, I personally suggest shorting around 65380-65800, targeting 64000-63200 near <a>#BTC #BTC走势分析 #ETH </a>

